  "title": "Mainstreaming adaptation in water management for flood protection in Isola Vicentina",
  "summary": "Isola Vicentina is prone to flooding stemming from the main rivers and the minor local drainage network, as well as, from extreme precipitation events, which are happening almost every year and are expected to increase in magnitude and frequency. Municipal Water Management Plans (MWMPs) enable an analysis of the local drainage system, getting an accurate picture over administrative and maintenance responsibilities, to identify the most urgent (and locally relevant) problems of poor drainage, and the related flood protection measures.",
